      "value": "STUBBLE v1.0 -- MOW, BALE, SELL. REPEAT UNTIL RICH.\n  > CO-OP: 2-4 PLAYERS VIA STEAM\n  > TOOLS: BARE HAND, SCYTHE, TRIMMER, PUSH MOWER, RIDE-ON\n  > BALES: SQUARE (NEAT) AND ROUND (CHAOS)\n  > CHEATS: TYPE 'BACK' AND ENTER SOME CLASSICS\n  > SECRETS: [REDACTED]. LOOK AROUND. PET THE CAT.\n  MADE WITH LOVE AND EXCESSIVE AMOUNTS OF GRASS."
    },
